# Screenshot Cleanup Shortcut
# iOS 17 - finds old screenshots and lets you delete them

1. Get All Photos (Media Type: Screenshots)
2. Filter Photos (Date Created < 30 days ago)
3. If No Photos Found:
   - Show "No old screenshots!"
4. Otherwise:
   - Select Photos (Show in grid)
   - For each selected photo:
     - Delete Photo (after confirmation)
5. Show Result: "Cleaned up X screenshots"

# Note: You need to give this shortcut permission to access photos
# First time it runs, iOS will ask for Full Access
